# FR-13.23/13.56 (#24) - the PRIVATE half of the backup seal key.
#
# The cluster gets a write-only public key; this is the half that can OPEN a sealed bundle,
# and a bundle carries every collection in an organisation. Committing it would publish, to
# GitHub, the one credential the asymmetric design exists to keep off the cluster.
# Generated by `bun scripts/backup-crypto.ts keygen`; it belongs in the password manager.
lgr-seal.key
*.seal.key
